    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SPACIOUS 4 BED FAMILY HOME IN LEAFY LANDSCAPED ESTATE CLOSE TO STILLORGAN & BLACKROCK\r\nNo 55. Coppinger Glade is an impressive four bedroom, semi-detached property, situated in the idyllic Coppinger estate. Set in this quiet cul-de-sac, overlooking the estate's parkland, but set back from the road behind a generous cobble-lock driveway, the house is an attractive redbrick with white porch, windows and timber features. \r\n\r\nEntering the property you are greeted by an impressive formal front living room, with cream carpets and traditional ornate open fireplace. Double doors lead through to the open-plan kitchen-dining room with french doors to garden. To the right there is an additional second living room, great for any family needing extra space, with timber laminate floors, traditional fireplace and sliding doors to the rear garden.  \r\n\r\nThe rear of the house is perfectly South-West facing, flooding the living areas with light. The private back garden has a neat stone patio area which ideally catches the sun all day, the rest laid with lush lawns and mature border shrubs and trees making this the perfect haven. To the side and front of the property there is a courtyard with gates, and a very useful outside utility room/laundry.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property provides four generous bedrooms, two spacious doubles (one ensuite bathroom) and two good sized single rooms. A main family bathroom is on the landing and a further guest WC downstairs.\r\n\r\nThe property has a good sized attic for storage, modern double glazing, gas fired central heating and gas hob.\r\nOverall the property is presented in excellent walk in ready condition.\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\n55 Coppinger Glade enjoys a superb setting in the heart of Stillorgan, one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential locations. The property benefits from an excellent range of local amenities, with Stillorgan Village just a short stroll away, offering a wide selection of supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday conveniences. Nearby both Blackrock Village and Dundrum Town Centre provides an extensive choice of retail, dining and entertainment options.\r\n\r\nThe area is exceptionally well connected, making it ideal for commuters. Numerous Dublin Bus routes operate along the nearby N11 Quality Bus Corridor, providing frequent services to Dublin City Centre, UCD and surrounding areas. The LUAS Green Line is easily accessible at Sandyford, Kilmacud and Stillorgan stops, while the M50 motorway is just minutes away, offering convenient access to Dublin Airport and the wider motorway network.\r\n\r\nFamilies are particularly well catered for, with an excellent selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools nearby, including St. Laurence's Boys National School, Oatlands College, Mount Anville Secondary School, St. Benildus College, Blackrock College and Coláiste Íosagáin & Coláiste Eoin. University College Dublin (UCD) is also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFor leisure and recreation, residents can enjoy the many parks, green spaces and the coastline in the area, including Deer Park, Carysfort Park and Kilbogget Park. A variety of sports clubs, golf courses, gyms and leisure facilities are close by, while the beautiful Dublin coastline at Blackrock, Seapoint and Sandycove is only a short drive away.\r\n\r\nCombining a quiet residential setting with outstanding transport links, excellent schools and an abundance of shopping, dining and recreational amenities, 55 Coppinger Glade offers an exceptional lifestyle in one of South Dublin's most convenient and established neighbourhoods."
      },
